**引理182.1（旗标平均后的正确块）。** 令
$f_j=\langle\Xi|\widetilde\sigma_{jj}|\Xi\rangle$。有一致展开

$$
\boxed{
\widetilde\sigma_{jj}
=\frac12P_\Xi+
\epsilon\left[
a_jP_\Xi+\frac{\beta c_j}{2}(P_\psi-P_\Xi)
\right]+O(\epsilon^2)
}
\tag{182.10}
$$

以及

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
f_j={}&\frac12+
\left(a_j-\frac{\beta c_j}{2}\right)\epsilon\\
&+\left[
-\beta c_ja_j-\frac{b_j^2}{2}-\frac{u_1^2}{2}
+\kappa u_1b_j+\gamma c_jb_j
+\kappa\gamma c_ju_1
\right]\epsilon^2
+O(\epsilon^3).
\end{aligned}
}
\tag{182.11}
$$

